At present, the legal regime to trafficking of women and children for commercial sexual exploitation includes the following:
A) Indian Penal Code, 1960;
B) ITPA, 1956;
C) J.J. Act, 2000;
D) Special laws of various states;
E) Rulings of Supreme Court and High Court.
